      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings, x running left to right (steep) and z front to back (gentle). A red ball starts on the bowl's side and takes up to 40 steps. Each step moves it by learning rate times a noisy slope estimate. An orange trail marks every step, and a faded blue ghost can keep the last run. A purple arrow shows the next mini-batch step and a dark arrow shows the full-data step. Readouts show the step number, loss, step length and status.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlM\",\"color\":\"#9db3cf\"},{\"id\":\"ballM\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"trailM\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"ghostM\",\"color\":\"#2a4a8a\"},{\"id\":\"stepM\",\"color\":\"#7b2fbf\"},{\"id\":\"fullM\",\"color\":\"#2f3640\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlG\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.7,2.33,2,1.7,1.44,1.2,1,0.84,0.7,0.6,0.54,0.5,0.5,0.54,0.6,0.7,0.84,1,1.2,1.44,1.7,2,2.33,2.7],[2.62,2.25,1.92,1.62,1.36,1.12,0.92,0.76,0.62,0.52,0.46,0.42,0.42,0.46,0.52,0.62,0.76,0.92,1.12,1.36,1.62,1.92,2.25,2.62],[2.54,2.17,1.84,1.54,1.28,1.04,0.84,0.68,0.54,0.44,0.38,0.34,0.34,0.38,0.44,0.54,0.68,0.84,1.04,1.28,1.54,1.84,2.17,2.54],[2.47,2.1,1.77,1.47,1.21,0.97,0.77,0.61,0.47,0.37,0.31,0.27,0.27,0.31,0.37,0.47,0.61,0.77,0.97,1.21,1.47,1.77,2.1,2.47],[2.41,2.04,1.71,1.41,1.15,0.91,0.71,0.55,0.41,0.31,0.25,0.21,0.21,0.25,0.31,0.41,0.55,0.71,0.91,1.15,1.41,1.71,2.04,2.41],[2.36,1.99,1.66,1.36,1.1,0.86,0.66,0.5,0.36,0.26,0.2,0.16,0.16,0.2,0.26,0.36,0.5,0.66,0.86,1.1,1.36,1.66,1.99,2.36],[2.31,1.94,1.61,1.31,1.05,0.81,0.61,0.45,0.31,0.21,0.15,0.11,0.11,0.15,0.21,0.31,0.45,0.61,0.81,1.05,1.31,1.61,1.94,2.31],[2.28,1.91,1.58,1.28,1.02,0.78,0.58,0.42,0.28,0.1